# One symbol per line — blocks X-SIGNAL eligibility/planning for that asset only.
# Copy to .xsignal_blocked_symbols (gitignored) to enable. Lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# If you block every followed asset: set X_SIGNAL_HONOR_FULL_BLOCKLIST=true in .env so
# X-SIGNAL equity stays off (no trades). With honor=false (default), nanoclaw logs a
# WARNING and ignores blocks for that cycle — easy to mistake for a working blocklist.
#
# Example (uncomment to use):
# WMATIC_ALPHA
# WETH_ALPHA
